{#
    The nested GARAN label on a tile (GA8; Michael, 2026-10-10: "GA8a").

    Commission guidelines, April 2026, 3.3.1: a compact element for
    space-limited places; "the harmonised label shall appear in its entirety on
    the first mouse click, mouse roll-over or tactile screen expansion". The
    link opens the full label at its own size — one click, also on a touch
    screen. 3.3: "always accompanied by accessible text and a link" — the
    alternative text carries the information as on the full label, the title
    says what the click does. 3.3.2: the link where the QR code leads stays
    next to it (GA10).

    Variable: garan {years, info, src, width, height, nested {src, width,
    height}} (DurabilityLabelImages::nestedOf()).
#}
{% set years = garan.years|replace({'.': 'MSC.decimalSeparator'|trans({}, 'contao_default')}) %}
<p class="consho-garan consho-garan--nested">
    <a href="{{ garan.src }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="{{ 'CONSHO.garan.open'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}">
        <img src="{{ garan.nested.src }}" alt="{{ 'CONSHO.garan.alt'|trans([years], 'contao_default') }}"{% if garan.nested.width %} width="{{ garan.nested.width }}" height="{{ garan.nested.height }}"{% endif %} loading="lazy">
    </a>
    {% if garan.info|default('') %}
        <a class="consho-garan__more" href="{{ garan.info }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ 'CONSHO.garan.more'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</a>
    {% endif %}
</p>
